    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "609 In Christi generatione Matthæus et Lucas dissentire videntur, propterea qnod cnm alter, id cst, Matthæus descendendo : alter, id est, Lucas ascen­ dendo, ejusdem generationis seriem texat.",
