  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Matthæus quidem ab Abraham exordium narrationis sumens, et ad David usque descendens, deinde per Salomo­ nem usque ad Joseph lineam deducit :",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lucas Vero a Joseph incipiens, per Nathan ad David, et a David usque ad Abraham , postremo ab Abraham usque ad Adam generationis ordinem revolvendo ascendit.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Unde contingit ut a David deorsum, cum ille per Natlian , iste per Salomonem generationis tramitem deducat, totus pene computationis ordo dissideat.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed qnia Scriptura sacra diversa quandoqne recipit, adversa autem omnino non admittit ; dum non per- mittimur credere contrarietatem , latentem cogimnr quarere veritatem.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Matthæus igitur generationem Christi descendendo computat, ostendens Fllium Dei per carnis susceptionem factum esse Filiun ho­ Minis :",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lucas eamdem ascendendo texit, demon­ strans filios hominum effici filios Dei per gratiam adoptionis.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propterea etiam Matthaeus generationis seriem usqne ad Christum natum ducere VOlenS, noh a primo parente Adam, sed ab Abraham exorsus est;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut ostenderet qnod susceptio carnis in Fllio Dei non fuit primæ conditionis institutio , sed promissionis postmodum factæ impletio.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lucas vero a Christo baptizato incipiens, non in David vel in Ahraham , sed nec in Adam finem fecit: sed per David et Abra­ ham atque Adam transiens, ad Deum ascendit;",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut aperte daret intelligi, quod ii qui per generationem carnis filii sunt hominum , per regenerationem ba­ ptismatis in adoptionem transeunt deitatis.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Idco Mat­ thaeus in genealogia non hist naturales filios compu­ tare voluit: Lucas vero inter naturales etiam ado­ ptivos ascrihit;",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut ostendatur et in Christo nascente vera fuisse carnis susceptio ,et in nobis renascen- tibus non per naturam , sed per gratiam provenire adoptio.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hæc ergo fuit causa quare in generationis serie alios Matthæus, et alios Lucas patres posuit ; quia ille, sicut diximus, solos naturales:",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "iste Vero naturalibus etiam adoptivos connumeravit. Quod ut melius patere possit, utrorumque narrationem con­ feramus.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ordo generationis Christi secundum Matthæum talis est: Abraham genuit lsaac, Isaac genuit Jacob,, Jacob genuit Judam, Judas genuit Phares,",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Pharet genuit Earon, Esron genuit Aram, Aram genuit ami­ nadab, Aminadab genuit Naason, Naasaon genuit Salmon,",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Salmon genuit Booz, Boox genuit Obed, Obed genuit hai, vel Jesse, Jesse genuit David, David genuit Salomonem, Salomon genuit Roboam,",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Roboam genuit Abiam, Abia genuit Asa, Asa genuit Josaphat, Jotaphat genuit Joram, Joram genuit Oziam (Matth.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "I, i et .eq.). Tres hic intermisit Evan­ gelisla, id est, Otiam sive Ochosiam, et Joas, et Amasiam;",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Joram enim primo loco genuit Ochoziam, et Ochosias genuit Joas, et Joas genuit AmaSiam, et Amasias demum genuit Oziam, de quo nunc di­ cilur: Joram genuit Oziam.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
