  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod ita intelligendum est, genuit videlicet mediantibus supradictis; quia per illos de semine ejus processit.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hos autem Evan­ gelista vel ideo prætermisit, ut numerus tesseræ decadis aequaretur : vel Ideo, quia Joram generi se miscuit Jezabel;",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he#PL17.HE.3.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et dictum erat per prophetam de domo Achab non esse quemquam regnaturum, nisi in quarta generatione : et ideo memoria ejus tolli­ tur, eo usque a sancta generatione.",
