    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-ambrosius/pl17_27_he",
    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "< Dicemus ergo aui unum propter supradictam ratio­ nem, sive aliam quamcumque ob causam præter- missum :",
