    "canonical_ref": "PL17.HE.3.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jechonias genuit Jechoniam, Jechonias ergo genuit Salathiel, Salalhiel genuit Zorobabel, Zorobabel genuit Abiud.",
